---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, "");
const api = `${base}/api/taskloom/documentation/taskloom`;
---
<BaseLayout title="Documentation">
  <p class="eyebrow">Guides and reference</p>
  <h1>Work with TaskLoom.</h1>
  <p class="lead">Start with a small operation, then choose the policies and platform bridges your application needs.</p>
  <div class="cards">
    <section class="card"><h2><a href={`${base}/documentation/getting-started/`}>Getting started</a></h2><p>Install the package and execute your first operation.</p></section>
    <section class="card"><h2><a href={`${api}/cancellationandretries/`}>Cancellation and retries</a></h2><p>Policy ordering, cooperative deadlines, first-completion races, and fallback behavior.</p></section>
    <section class="card"><h2><a href={`${api}/tasklifetimes/`}>Task lifetimes</a></h2><p>Main-actor helpers, explicit ownership, and serial queues.</p></section>
    <section class="card"><h2><a href={`${api}/combineanddispatch/`}>Combine and Dispatch</a></h2><p>Publisher bridges, scheduler helpers, cancellation tokens, and platform availability.</p></section>
    <section class="card"><h2><a href={`${api}/`}>API reference</a></h2><p>DocC documentation generated from the same checkout as this website.</p></section>
    <section class="card"><h2><a href="https://github.com/modern-swift-dev/taskloom-swift/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md">Contributing</a></h2><p>Build, test, and improve the documentation locally.</p></section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
